#### Coba
GET http://192.168.10.11/led
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": true
}

#### Test Jammer On
POST http://192.168.10.11/jammer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "jamm_freq": 5800,
    "is_on": true
}

#### Test Jammer On
POST http://192.168.10.11/jammer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "jamm_freq": 2400,
    "is_on": false
}

#### Test Fan On
POST http://192.168.10.11/fan
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "is_on": false
}

#### Set RGB notification
POST http://192.168.10.11/notifRGB
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "is_on": true,
    "r": 20,
    "g": 200,
    "b": 200
}

#### Set RGB animation
POST http://192.168.10.11/animateRGB
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "is_on": true
}

#### Get Temperature
GET http://192.168.10.11/temp